  "outlook": "Outlook for the Fourth Quarter Fiscal 2026: The Company expects net sales to be approximately $495.0 million to $505.0 million in the fourth quarter of fiscal 2026, compared to $437.7 million in the prior year, for a growth rate of 13.1% to 15.4%. Excluding net sales from VACCO, net sales are expected to grow 6.4% to 8.7%. Adjusted gross margin is expected to be in the range of 45.0% to 45.25% and SG&A as a percentage of net sales is expected to be in the range of 16.0% to 16.25%."
